                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "You are standing where the haul road bends. Everything the quarry cuts goes past me — on my back or on my cart. If you cannot carry a battle, you cannot carry a load."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "Boots first, back second, team third. That is hauling. My two carry more weight than most whole parties — want to test the load?"
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "The paddies are behind you and the stone is ahead. Different masters, same lesson. Weight tells the truth about a trainer."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Helda Ironstep",
                    Label: "default"
                }
            ]
